+# Fetching
+
+Source: `manifest.tsv` (323 entries), public `CLAUDE.md` / `AGENTS.md` files located via
+GitHub code search (grep.app), fetched raw. Files are fetched incrementally, not all at
+once, because the fetch has to respect a per-domain rate limit (see `GATE1.md`: 115 of
+323 files were on disk at measurement time).
+
+## Rate limit
+
+Per-domain limit observed for this corpus's fetch (Svipall): **12 visits per 60 s
+window per domain**, with a **900 s cooldown** imposed after a breach.
+
+## Hosts used
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com` — primary, used for the bulk of `manifest.tsv`.
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/<owner>/<repo>@<branch>/<path>` — mirror.
+- `cdn.statically.io` — mirror; observed to be slow / prone to timeouts.
+
+`unavailable.tsv` records entries that could not be fetched (e.g. 404s).
+
+These figures come from project memory of the fetch run (trust level 1: observed in
+this project's own transcripts, not read back out of a committed log file), not from a
+document in this repository. If you need to re-verify them, re-run the fetch and watch
+for 429/backoff behavior against each host.
